  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là tâm hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/80065b66a45f19d8218b73c5f38fdf3950626ed9bbdab735c197366e2ef44882.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, hay là góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
